{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54521","headline":"兵要望江南 占云第三（京本作「占云第二十四○二十六首」） 八 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占云第三（京本作「占云第二十四○二十六首」） 八","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"云起处（京本作「气至」），低覆似人形。\n此是贼军（辛本作「兵」）谋我象（京本作「重」），须防入境起征凶（京本作「凶征」），遣将用精兵。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54521.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54521","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}